<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 553 ALL OUT V ZIMBABWE (375).</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 553 ALL OUT V ZIMBABWE (375).</headline>
<dateline>SHEIKHUPURA, Pakistan 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan were all out for 553 in reply to Zimbabwe's first innings total of 375 on the fourth day of the first cricket test on Sunday.</p>
</text>
